# oracle: eFF H2 (128 electrons and nuclei, periodic) under fix nph/eff with an isotropic barostat (target pressure 0, period 1): barostat velocities, box remap and chains, 10 steps from velocity create 300 K (examples/PACKAGES/eff/H2 box, cut down)
# oracle-inputs: w63eff_h2.data
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-7 abs=1e-9
units           electron
newton          on
boundary        p p p
atom_style      electron
read_data       w63eff_h2.data
pair_style      eff/cut 6.447968 pressure/evirials
pair_coeff      * *
comm_modify     vel yes
thermo          2
thermo_style    custom step pe ke temp press vol
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
velocity        all create 300.0 4928459 dist gaussian rot yes mom yes
timestep        0.0005
fix             1 all nph/eff iso 0.0 0.0 1.0
run             10
